              "       Algorithm X in 5s.  Report an exact count, or a sampled density\n"
              "       estimate, AND the measured cost of your strongest attack.\n"
              "       See prompts/codex_task.md, G5.")
        sys.exit(1)
if not any(k.startswith("G8") for k in gates):
