+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Verified generators for sub-square-root planted-clique recovery.
+
+This is the r=t=0 special case of Definition 2 in Khanna, "Exact
+recovery of planted cliques in semi-random graphs" (arXiv:2011.08447).
+The witness is sampled before the background graph, so generation never
+solves an instance it has just made.
+"""
