codex
The competing draft also confirms the same technical boundary but attempted a below-threshold build. Its own strongest-route accounting counts only clique verification after the witness is already known, not the operations needed to discover the witness, so it does not satisfy G9(c)’s definition. I’m waiting briefly for the concurrent writer to finish before finalizing the retained rejection files.
